%% Sprint Flight-1 — Sequence: Mark Bagged + Auto-add Day 2 to grade
%% Spec: Docs/specs/sprint-flight-1.md (RF-04 + RF-11)
%% ADRs: 090 (bagged_at substitui flight_advanced)
%%
%% Fluxo: Founder click "Marcar Day 1 X bagged" em qualquer dos 3 contextos
%% (lista de torneios, /flight/:id, detail tournament). Endpoint cria/atualiza
%% planned_tournament Day 2 com series_id setado, status='upcoming'. Idempotente:
%% chamar 2x nao duplica planned. Se Day 2 ja completed, retorna 409.

sequenceDiagram
    actor F as Founder
    participant U as UI (3 contextos):<br/>TournamentLibrary,<br/>/flight/:id,<br/>TournamentDetail
    participant D as MarkBaggedDialog<br/>(componente DRY)
    participant API as POST /api/tournament-series/<br/>:id/mark-bagged (RF-04)
    participant ST as storage.ts
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(tournament_series, tournaments,<br/>planned_tournaments)
    participant Q as TanStack Query

    F->>U: Click "Marcar bagged"<br/>(visivel se series_id != null<br/>AND bagged_at IS NULL)
    U->>D: open(MarkBaggedDialog)
    D->>D: Pre-preenche datetime<br/>(de series.day2DateTime)<br/>+ stackMode (de series)

    F->>D: Confirma (ou edita datetime)<br/>+ comentario opcional
    D->>API: POST /api/tournament-series/:seriesId/mark-bagged<br/>{tournamentId, day2DateTime?, stackMode?}

    API->>API: requireAuth (JWT)
    API->>ST: getSeriesById(userId, seriesId)<br/>(owner check)

    alt series nao pertence ao user OU nao existe
        ST-->>API: null
        API-->>D: 404 {message: 'Not found'}
        D->>F: Toast erro
    end

    API->>ST: getTournamentById(userId, tournamentId)<br/>(owner check)

    alt tournament.seriesId !== :id
        API-->>D: 404 {message: 'tournament not linked to this series'}
    end

    alt series.day2Status === 'completed'
        API-->>D: 409 {message: 'Day 2 already completed'}
        D->>F: Toast "Day 2 ja foi jogado"
    end

    alt series.day2DateTime IS NULL E body sem day2DateTime
        API-->>D: 400 {message: 'day2DateTime required'}
    end

    API->>ST: db.transaction(async tx => ...)

    Note over ST: 1. Atualiza tournament.bagged_at = NOW()<br/>(substitui flight_advanced=true legado — ADR-090)
    ST->>DB: UPDATE tournaments<br/>SET bagged_at = NOW()<br/>WHERE id = tournamentId

    Note over ST: 2. Atualiza series.day2DateTime se body trouxe valor novo
    alt body.day2DateTime !== series.day2DateTime
        ST->>DB: UPDATE tournament_series<br/>SET day2_datetime = ?, updated_at = NOW()
    end

    Note over ST: 3. Idempotencia (D5): re-checa planned existente<br/>antes de inserir
    ST->>DB: SELECT * FROM planned_tournaments<br/>WHERE series_id = :id<br/>AND day_of_week = derived(day2DateTime)
    DB-->>ST: existing planned (ou vazio)

    alt planned ja existe
        alt datetime diferente
            ST->>DB: UPDATE planned_tournaments<br/>SET start_time = day2DateTime,<br/>time = formatted HH:mm
            Note over ST: Atualiza, NAO duplica (D5)
        else datetime igual
            Note over ST: No-op — idempotente
        end
    else planned nao existe
        ST->>DB: INSERT INTO planned_tournaments<br/>(series_id, day_of_week, time,<br/>start_time, status='upcoming',<br/>name=series.name + ' — Day 2',<br/>site=series.network, buy_in=0,<br/>type='Vanilla', speed='Normal')
        DB-->>ST: novo planned
    end

    ST-->>API: tx commit<br/>{updatedSeries, plannedDay2}

    API-->>D: 200 OK<br/>{series: {...updated}, plannedDay2: {...}}

    D->>Q: queryClient.invalidateQueries:<br/>['tournaments'], ['tournament-series'],<br/>['planned-tournaments']

    D->>F: Toast "Day 2 adicionado a grade<br/>(domingo 19h00)"
    D->>D: Fecha dialog

    Note over F,DB: Domingo 18h45 founder ve Day 2 na grade.<br/>Apos jogar, reconcile pos-sessao (RF-12) detecta<br/>tournament.series_id != null e marca series.day2Status='completed'<br/>+ calcula P&L combined-stack (RF-15).
